801
00:43:13.134 --> 00:43:16.007
It's been a very long day.
a very long week.

802
00:43:16.268 --> 00:43:18.052
- I haven't slept. so...
- Oh. you're fine.

803
00:43:18.313 --> 00:43:19.488
- Sorry. [clears throat]
- I am looking into

804
00:43:19.749 --> 00:43:22.187
