805
00:43:27.018 --> 00:43:28.584
[phone buzzing]

806
00:43:30.717 --> 00:43:32.110
[Bobby sighs softly]

807
00:43:32.980 --> 00:43:34.547
Yep.

808
00:43:35.591 --> 00:43:36.897
We're en route to...

809
00:43:37.158 --> 00:43:39.117
Oh. no. no. no. We can't divert.

810
00:43:39.291 --> 00:43:41.467
Got Joe's family with me.

811
00:43:44.557 --> 00:43:45.688
You get by with two?

812
00:43:45.950 --> 00:43:47.473
