are with me.

823
00:44:14.630 --> 00:44:16.371
What about all our shit
in the back?

824
00:44:16.545 --> 00:44:17.503
You're gonna cram all your shit
in the Suburban just like

825
00:44:17.677 --> 00:44:18.721
it's a fucking Humvee.

826
00:44:18.983 --> 00:44:20.071
Come on. let's go.

827
00:44:23.639 --> 00:44:25.859
