- I'm fucking not okay. either.

834
00:45:34.406 --> 00:45:37.235
- Charlie.
- [chuckles] Yeah. Good kids.

835
00:45:37.409 --> 00:45:38.453
Hey.

836
00:45:39.585 --> 00:45:41.587
You work with my wife?

837
00:45:42.675 --> 00:45:44.372
I asked you a question.
Do you work with my wife?

838
00:45:44.633 --> 00:45:46.113
You're gonna have to ask
your wife those questions. sir.

839
00:45:46.374 --> 00:45:48.159
