I'm sorry.

909
00:51:19.925 --> 00:51:23.058
I'm so sorry.

910
00:51:23.232 --> 00:51:25.234
- I'm sorry.
- Come here. Come here.

911
00:51:25.409 --> 00:51:27.280
I'm so sorry.

912
00:51:37.638 --> 00:51:40.032
I'm so sorry.

913
00:51:41.512 --> 00:51:43.340
